<h1>📜 Internal Regulations — Attendance &amp; Conduct Grid</h1>
<p class="intro">Official published summary of the center internal regulations. The full paper version is available at the administration office and on the bulletin board.</p>
<div class="card"><h2>📅 Attendance (15-point grid)</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Points deducted</th><th>Sanction</th><th>Decision authority</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td data-label="Case">Late arrival (after 15 min grace)</td><td data-label="Points deducted">-0.25</td><td data-label="Sanction">per late</td><td data-label="Decision authority">Counted in the attendance grid</td></tr>
<tr><td data-label="Case">Absence of one session</td><td data-label="Points deducted">-0.5</td><td data-label="Sanction">per session</td><td data-label="Decision authority">Counted in the attendance grid</td></tr>
<tr><td data-label="Case">Full-day absence (3 sessions)</td><td data-label="Points deducted">-1.5</td><td data-label="Sanction">sum of sessions</td><td data-label="Decision authority">Counted in the attendance grid</td></tr>
<tr><td data-label="Case">Partial absence (early leave after 15 min grace)</td><td data-label="Points deducted">by minutes missed</td><td data-label="Sanction">share of session penalty</td><td data-label="Decision authority">Counted in the attendance grid</td></tr>
<tr><td data-label="Case">Total lost -1 / -2</td><td data-label="Points deducted">—</td><td data-label="Sanction">First / second warning</td><td data-label="Decision authority">General Guard</td></tr>
<tr><td data-label="Case">Total lost -3 / -4</td><td data-label="Points deducted">—</td><td data-label="Sanction">First / second notice</td><td data-label="Decision authority">Director</td></tr>
<tr><td data-label="Case">Total lost -5</td><td data-label="Points deducted">—</td><td data-label="Sanction">Reprimand — referred to the council</td><td data-label="Decision authority">Disciplinary Council</td></tr>
<tr><td data-label="Case">Total lost -6</td><td data-label="Points deducted">—</td><td data-label="Sanction">Two-day suspension by council decision</td><td data-label="Decision authority">Disciplinary Council</td></tr>
<tr><td data-label="Case">Total lost -7</td><td data-label="Points deducted">—</td><td data-label="Sanction">Temporary or final suspension by council decision</td><td data-label="Decision authority">Disciplinary Council</td></tr>
<tr><td data-label="Case">Total lost -15 (grid exhausted)</td><td data-label="Points deducted">—</td><td data-label="Sanction">Council decides on expulsion</td><td data-label="Decision authority">Disciplinary Council</td></tr>
<tr><td data-label="Case">More than 10 days of unjustified absence</td><td data-label="Points deducted">—</td><td data-label="Sanction">Admin notified to refer the case to the council</td><td data-label="Decision authority">Disciplinary Council</td></tr>
<tr><td data-label="Case">More than 10 days of justified absence</td><td data-label="Points deducted">—</td><td data-label="Sanction">Pedagogical suspension until a readiness test is passed</td><td data-label="Decision authority">Teacher</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<p style="color:var(--gray);font-size:.9rem;margin-top:10px;">The figures above are the values actually applied by the system; the director may change them in the settings panel.</p>
</div>
<div class="card"><h2>🚦 Conduct / 5 points</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Points deducted</th><th>Sanction</th><th>Decision authority</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td data-label="Case">Conduct violation no. 1</td><td data-label="Points deducted">-1</td><td data-label="Sanction">Warning</td><td data-label="Decision authority">General Guard</td></tr>
<tr><td data-label="Case">Conduct violation no. 2</td><td data-label="Points deducted">-1</td><td data-label="Sanction">Notice</td><td data-label="Decision authority">Director</td></tr>
<tr><td data-label="Case">Conduct violation no. 3</td><td data-label="Points deducted">-1</td><td data-label="Sanction">Reprimand</td><td data-label="Decision authority">Director</td></tr>
<tr><td data-label="Case">Conduct violation no. 4</td><td data-label="Points deducted">-1</td><td data-label="Sanction">2-day suspension (lifted automatically)</td><td data-label="Decision authority">Director</td></tr>
<tr><td data-label="Case">Conduct violation no. 5</td><td data-label="Points deducted">-1</td><td data-label="Sanction">Automatic expulsion (student may appeal; the director may cancel it)</td><td data-label="Decision authority">Director</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<p style="color:var(--gray);font-size:.9rem;margin-top:10px;">The sanction level escalates with the number of non-cancelled violations within 365 days. Each violation deducts one full point; cancelling a violation restores the deduction and the status.</p>
</div>
<div class="card"><h2>🧮 Official equivalences</h2>
<ul class="eq-list"><li>One session = 2.5 hours</li><li>One day = 7.5 hours (3 sessions)</li><li>One lateness = -0.25 points</li><li>One session absence = -0.5 points</li><li>Initial balance 20 points</li></ul>
</div>
<div class="note">⚖️ Any appeal or justification is submitted at the administration office per the adopted procedure and decided within a reasonable delay.</div>
